hat the four nations and even the four elements are actually one and the same. While he successfully guided Aang through the first six stages of enlightenment, their bond was tested at the final "Thought Chakra," which required Aang to let go of his earthly attachment to Katara. Pathik is often viewed as a controversial figure by fans; while his wisdom is undeniable, some argue his rigid view of detachment was better suited for a monk than for an Avatar, whose duty is inherently tied to the world and its people.	https://avatar.fandom.com/wiki/Pathik
