Akagi to further NERVΓÇÖs technological progress. Despite his outward callousness, his actions are deeply rooted in a "HedgehogΓÇÖs Dilemma" similar to ShinjiΓÇÖs; he keeps others at a distance out of a fear of causing or receiving further emotional pain. Ultimately, Gendo remains one of the most polarizing figures in the series, serving as a dark reflection of what becomes of a person who allows grief and the pursuit of a singular truth to erase their humanity.	https://evangelion.fandom.com/wiki/Gendo_Ikari
