Kurama	{https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/yuyuhakusho/images/9/9d/Kurama_%282018_OVA%29_1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20230707051037,https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/yuyuhakusho/images/e/e1/Kurama_portrait_2_YYH.png/revision/latest?cb=20230620024246,https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/yuyuhakusho/images/f/f3/Jury%C5%8D_Y%C5%8Dzan_Ken_YYH.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/732?cb=20230708041907,https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/characterprofile/images/0/09/Kurama.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/330?cb=20160503165639,https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/characterprofile/images/5/5e/Youko_Kurama_6.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20170121192204,https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/1/19/KuramaYuYuHakusho.png/250px-KuramaYuYuHakusho.png,https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/deathbattlefanon/images/f/f3/KuramaOfficial.png/revision/latest?cb=20150307035535}	YuYu Hakusho	69	In YuYu Hakusho, Kurama is the human reincarnation of a legendary, silver-haired fox demon and master thief known as Yoko Kurama. After being mortally wounded by hunters from the Spirit World over a thousand years ago, his soul fled to the Human World and merged with the embryo of a human child named Shuichi Minamino. While he initially planned to leave his human family once his demonic powers were restored, KuramaΓÇÖs cold, predatory nature was softened by the unconditional love of his human mother, Shiori. This bond eventually led him to risk his life to save hers, turning a former criminal into one of the most compassionate and fiercely loyal allies of the Spirit Detective, Yusuke Urameshi.\n\nOn the battlefield, Kurama is the primary strategist of Team Urameshi, renowned for his analytical brilliance and his ability to remain calm under extreme pressure. He specializes in the manipulation of demonic plants, most notably his signature Rose Whip, which he creates by infusing a simple rose with spiritual energy. While his human form is polite and soft-spoken, he can be terrifyingly ruthless when his loved ones are threatened, often employing psychological warfare and lethal traps that leave no room for escape. During the Dark Tournament and beyond, he gains the ability to temporarily revert to his Yoko Kurama form, unleashing the overwhelming S-Class power and cold-blooded instincts of his original demonic self.	https://yuyuhakusho.fandom.com/wiki/Kurama
Koenma	{https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/yuyuhakusho/images/2/2d/Koenma_portrait_4_yyh.png/revision/latest?cb=20231118015937,https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/yuyuhakusho/images/e/e4/Koenma_003_YYH.png/revision/latest?cb=20230716204109,https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/yuyuhakusho/images/e/e1/Koenma_ep87_%28YYH%29_1.png/revision/latest?cb=20220422051654,https://static0.cbrimages.com/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Koenma-10-Anime-Characters-That-Look-Young-But-Are-Hundreds-Of-Years-Old-Entry-Image.jpg,https://static0.cbrimages.com/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Yu-Yu-Hakusho-Koenma-Flies-With-Yusuke.jpg,https://static0.cbrimages.com/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Yu-Yu-Hakusho-Koenma-Uses-His-Pacifier.jpg?q=50&fit=crop&w=825&dpr=1.5}	YuYu Hakusho	71	King Enma Jr., commonly known as Koenma, is the prince of the Spirit World and the son of Great King Enma. Despite being over 700 years old, he typically appears as a toddler wearing a blue robe and a signature pacifier. As the person in charge of the Spirit World's bureaucracy while his father is away, Koenma is the one who recruits Yusuke Urameshi as a Spirit Detective. While he often serves as comic reliefΓÇöconstantly bickering with his ogre assistant, Jorge, or engaging in a sibling-like rivalry with YusukeΓÇöhe is a dedicated leader who feels a deep sense of responsibility for the balance between the human and spirit realms.\n\nKoenmaΓÇÖs most defining feature is his blue pacifier, which is actually a powerful storage vessel for his spiritual energy. For centuries, he has funneled his aura into it to create the Ma-fukan (Evil Seal), the strongest defensive spell in the Spirit World, intended to seal away catastrophic threats. While he prefers to stay in the Spirit World, he can transform into a tall, handsome young man to travel through the Human and Demon Worlds more inconspicuously. Though he is not primarily a front-line fighter, his courage shines during the Chapter Black saga, where he is willing to sacrifice his accumulated power and his own standing in the Spirit World to protect his friends and do what is morally right.	https://yuyuhakusho.fandom.com/wiki/Koenma
