pulate its shape into a javelin or whip, and eventually develops the Dimension Sword, a rare and powerful weapon capable of cutting through the fabric of space and dimensional barriers. While he eventually steps away from the supernatural world to focus on his education and a more normal life, he remains the most powerful full human on Earth by the series' end.	https://yuyuhakusho.fandom.com/wiki/Kazuma_Kuwabara
