 Icha" novels. Despite his seemingly relaxed attitude, he remains one of the village's most formidable tactical minds and versatile warriors, having mastered over a thousand jutsu including his signature Lightning Blade. His service to the village extended through numerous global crises, culminating in his pivotal role during the Fourth Shinobi World War. Following the conflict, his immense contributions and leadership led to his appointment as the Sixth Hokage, where he oversaw a period of peace and modernization for the Hidden Leaf. Even after retiring from the position, he continues to serve as a wise advisor and protector, solidifying his legacy as one of the most respected figures in shinobi history.	https://naruto.fandom.com/wiki/Kakashi_Hatake
